<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch Exploration started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch Exploration started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities said it initiated coverage of Enserch Exploration Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/4 at 8-7/8.</p>
</text>
